ot abrogate a verse or cause it to be forgotten except that We bring forth [one] better than it or similar to it. Do you not know that Allāh is over all things competent?","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":106,"sd":null},{"k":"2:107","t":"Do you not know that to Allāh belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth and [that] you have not besides Allāh any protector or any helper?","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":107,"sd":null},{"k":"2:108","t":"Or do you intend to ask your Messenger as Moses was asked before? And whoever exchanges faith for disbelief has certainly strayed from the soundness of the way.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":108,"sd":null},{"k":"2:109","t":"Many of the People of the Scripture wish they could turn you back to disbelief after you have believed, out of envy from themselves [even] after the truth has become clear to them. So pardon and overlook until Allāh delivers His command. Indeed, Allāh is over all things competent.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":109,"sd":null},{"k":"2:110","t":"And establish prayer and give zakāh, and whatever good you put forward for yourselves - you will find it with Allāh. Indeed Allāh, of what you do, is Seeing.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":110,"sd":null},{"k":"2:111","t":"And they say, \"None will enter Paradise except one who is a Jew or a Christian.\" That is [merely] their wishful thinking. Say, \"Produce your proof, if you should be truthful.\"","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":111,"sd":null},{"k":"2:112","t":"Yes, [on the contrary], whoever submits his face [i.e., self] in Islām to Allāh while being a doer of good will have his reward with his Lord. And no fear will there be concerning them, nor will they grieve.","j":1,"h":2,"s":2,"a":112,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":2,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}